    <chapter title="Test Scenarios">
        <procedure title="Adds a Firm Sanction Criteria" id="test-1">
            <p><b>Scenario:</b> Add Firm Sanction Criterion</p>
            <p>Adds a new firm sanction criterion with risk point, regulation group, and category</p>
            <step>1. Open Firm Sanction Criteria page. 2. Click "Add". 3. Enter Name and Risk Point. 4. Select Regulation Group. 5. Select Category. 6. Click Save.</step>
            <chapter title="Expected Results">
                <p>• Criterion is added and success toast appears.</p>
            </chapter>
        </procedure>
